<title>THAILAND: Thai exchange suspends Jalaprathan shares.</title>
<headline>Thai exchange suspends Jalaprathan shares.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Stock Exchange of Thailand said on Wednesday it suspended trading in shares of cement company Jalaprathan Cement Plc.</p>
<p>The exchange said the stock was suspended pending the company's release of details of a proposed capital increase.</p>
<p>The company's shares last traded at 12.75 baht, compared to a year high of 75 baht.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
